<title>RUSSIA: Russia sets 33.70 pct coupon on bond.</title>
<headline>Russia sets 33.70 pct coupon on bond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Finance Ministry will pay quarterly interest of 84,019 roubles per bond on April 16 on the two-year OFZ government bond maturing July 15, 1998 (series 24008), the Central Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The interest is equivalent to an annual rate of 33.70 percent.</p>
<p>Coupon date  Coupon number  Interest volume  Annual rate</p>
<p>    Jan 8	  2		  121,018 roubles  48.54 pct</p>
<p>    April 16     3		   84,019 roubles  33.70 pct</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
